          "name": "Poison Gas",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "3/day, a neochu can release a poison gas from itself spread outward in a 30-ft.-radius. Creatures within the area of effect take 12d6 points of non-elemental damage and are inflicted with Poison status for 1d6 rounds. A successful Fortitude save (DC 20) negates the status effect and reduces the damage by half. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 6th level spell (Knowledge: Nature DC 27).",
